  "interpretation": {
    "evidence": "Both age-injection pipelines underperformed A0, and T1 additionally underperformed its equal-capacity P1 control. Routing the residual through a frozen final transformer block perturbs special-token attention/FFN trajectories without allowing the pretrained tail to adapt; the fixed nonlinear tail can also rotate or attenuate the age direction, whereas P1 preserves the locked pooled representation and adds a direct path.",
